### Industry API Requests

### Get all industries
GET http://localhost:8080/api/industries

### Get industry by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/industries/1

### Create new industry
POST http://localhost:8080/api/industries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics"
}

### Update industry
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/industries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics Manufacturing"
}

### Delete industry
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/industries/4

