### Product API Requests

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### Get products by country
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/country/1

### Get products by industry
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/industry/1

### Create new product (simple)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "hsCode": "8471.30",
  "description": "Portable computer"
}

### Create product with country and industry
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/country/1/industry/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smartphone",
  "hsCode": "8517.12",
  "description": "Mobile phone"
}

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "hsCode": "8471.30",
  "description": "High-performance portable computer"
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

###############################################

### User API Requests

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1

### Get user by username
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/username/john_doe

### Create new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "$Password12345",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe_updated",
  "password": "newpassword123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/1

