### TariffRule API Requests

### Get all tariff rules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules

### Get tariff rule by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/1

### Get tariff rules by country
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/country/1

### Get tariff rules by product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/product/1

### Create new tariff rule (simple)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rate": 15.50,
  "additionalFee": 100.00,
  "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
  "expiryDate": "2024-12-31"
}

### Create tariff rule with country and product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/country/1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rate": 12.75,
  "additionalFee": 50.00,
  "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
  "expiryDate": "2024-12-31"
}

### Update tariff rule (simple)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rate": 18.00,
  "additionalFee": 120.00,
  "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
  "expiryDate": "2024-12-31"
}

### Update tariff rule with country and product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/country/1/product/1/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rate": 14.50,
  "additionalFee": 80.00,
  "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
  "expiryDate": "2024-12-31"
}

### Delete tariff rule (simple)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/1

### Delete tariff rule with country and product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/country/1/product/1/1

