### ImportRecord API Requests

### Get all import records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/import-records

### Get import record by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/1

### Get import records by product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/product/1

### Get import records by user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/user/1

### Create new import record (simple)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 100,
  "date": "2024-09-20T10:30:00",
  "calculatedTariffAmount": 1500.00,
  "value": 10000.00
}

### Create import record with product and user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/product/1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 50,
  "date": "2024-09-20T10:30:00",
  "calculatedTariffAmount": 750.00,
  "value": 5000.00
}

### Update import record (simple)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 150,
  "date": "2024-09-20T11:00:00",
  "calculatedTariffAmount": 2250.00,
  "value": 15000.00
}

### Update import record with product and user
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/product/1/user/1/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 200,
  "date": "2024-09-20T12:00:00",
  "calculatedTariffAmount": 3000.00,
  "value": 20000.00
}

### Delete import record (simple)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/1

### Delete import record with product and user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/product/1/user/1/1

### Calculation Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tariffs/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "fromCountry": "North Korea",
  "toCountry": "United States of America",
  "productId": 10129,
  "unitCost": 25,
  "quantity": 1000,
  "effectiveYear": 2025
}

