### Protected Endpoints Tests (Require Authentication)

### Test Protected Product Creation (ADMIN only) - replace JWT_TOKEN with actual token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "hsCode": "123456"
}

### Test Protected Product Update (ADMIN only) - replace JWT_TOKEN with actual token
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "hsCode": "654321"
}

### Test Protected Country Creation (ADMIN only) - replace JWT_TOKEN with actual token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/countries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "countryCode": "C999",
  "name": "Test Country"
}

### Get Users (Protected) - replace JWT_TOKEN with actual token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Create User (Protected) - replace JWT_TOKEN with actual token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "USER"
}
