### Tariff Rates Over Time

### India's tariff rates on imports FROM China for Product 10120 (1996-2025)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/rates-over-time?fromCountryCode=C156&toCountryCode=C356&productId=10120

### USA's tariff rates on imports FROM China for Product 10111
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/rates-over-time?fromCountryCode=C156&toCountryCode=C840&productId=10111

### China's tariff rates on imports FROM India for Product 10120
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/rates-over-time?fromCountryCode=C356&toCountryCode=C156&productId=10120

###############################################

### Tariff Comparison (Shows BOTH directions)

### Compare India vs China for Product 10120 - shows BOTH countries' rates
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tariff-rules/compare-tariffs?country1Code=C356&country2Code=C156&productId=10120
